       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. KYC8B2.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PERIODIC-UPDATION    PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-UPDATED-INFO-RECEIVED PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-CUSTOMER-ID           PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-REGISTRY-STATUS       PIC X(8) VALUE 'NOT-SENT'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-PERIODIC-UPDATION
           ACCEPT WS-UPDATED-INFO-RECEIVED
           ACCEPT WS-CUSTOMER-ID
           IF WS-PERIODIC-UPDATION = 'Y' OR
              WS-UPDATED-INFO-RECEIVED = 'Y'
              CALL 'KYH4C3' USING WS-CUSTOMER-ID WS-REGISTRY-STATUS
           END-IF
           DISPLAY WS-REGISTRY-STATUS
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM KYC8B2.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. KYH4C3.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-CUSTOMER-ID           PIC X(16).
       01  LK-REGISTRY-STATUS       PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-CUSTOMER-ID LK-REGISTRY-STATUS.
       2000-UPLOAD-REGISTRY.
           IF LK-CUSTOMER-ID NOT = SPACES
              MOVE 'UPLOADED' TO LK-REGISTRY-STATUS
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM KYH4C3.
